From: claude <claude@p7x.dev>
Subject: [PATCH v2 05/16] jails/instances/lab-claude: Post patch series with
 git send-email
To: lab@lists.p7x.dev
Cc: Pat Maddox <pat@patmaddox.com>
Change-Id: ypxzqsurorrtrqsysovroyvonsrkoxsr
Date: Sun, 18 Oct 2026 02:33:30 +0000

Once the agent posts through lab-mail, a patch series goes out with
git send-email, which keeps the Message-ID that format-patch gave
each patch and dates each message as it is posted. It needs to know
to use msmtp, and to post without asking, since nobody is there to
answer.
---
change-id: ypxzqsurorrtrqsysovroyvonsrkoxsr

 jails/instances/lab-claude/README.org                  | 6 ++++++
 jails/instances/lab-claude/dist/home/claude/.gitconfig | 7 +++++++
 2 files changed, 13 insertions(+)

diff --git a/jails/instances/lab-claude/README.org b/jails/instances/lab-claude/README.org
index fd00ebf9..8e3d190a 100644
--- a/jails/instances/lab-claude/README.org
+++ b/jails/instances/lab-claude/README.org
@@ -32,6 +32,12 @@ from the To, Cc and Bcc headers:
 msmtp -t < message.eml
 #+END_EXAMPLE
 
+git send-email posts a patch series through msmtp, as =.gitconfig=
+sets, taking the recipients from each patch:
+#+BEGIN_EXAMPLE
+git send-email /tmp/series/*.patch
+#+END_EXAMPLE
+
 lab-mail delivers mail for =lab-devel@p7x.dev=, =lab@lists.p7x.dev=,
 and =freebsd-ports@lists.p7x.dev= to the list, and
 accepts and discards mail for =pat@p7x.dev=, =pat@patmaddox.com=, and
diff --git a/jails/instances/lab-claude/dist/home/claude/.gitconfig b/jails/instances/lab-claude/dist/home/claude/.gitconfig
index 3d77516d..93c9f8b6 100644
--- a/jails/instances/lab-claude/dist/home/claude/.gitconfig
+++ b/jails/instances/lab-claude/dist/home/claude/.gitconfig
@@ -6,3 +6,10 @@
 	# as dubious ownership unless they are marked safe.
 	directory = /data/lab.git
 	directory = /data/lab-submissions.git
+[sendemail]
+	# Post patch series to the list through lab-mail, from the
+	# address in each patch's From, without asking.
+	sendmailCmd = msmtp
+	envelopeSender = auto
+	confirm = never
+	suppressCc = self
